*.json

# Engine reference data vendored with DLP.RegexFilter and REQUIRED at build time
# (both are CopyToOutputDirectory content). The broad *.json rule above swallowed
# them when the submodule was vendored, so CI checked out without them and the QA
# container build failed with MSB3030 "patterns.json / filetypes.json not found".
# Keep these two tracked; the *.json rule still hides scanner-settings.json etc.
!ScannerEngine/DLP.RegexFilter/patterns.json
!ScannerEngine/DLP.RegexFilter/filetypes.json

